Summary:
Today’s session involved refining the completed Multi-Vendor E-commerce Platform by improving the overall project structure and ensuring all components were working smoothly. The focus was on cleaning up the codebase, organizing files properly, and enhancing the frontend presentation for a more professional look. Necessary updates were made to ensure better readability and consistency across the project. Additionally, the project was prepared for version control by reviewing all required files and documentation.

Outcomes:
The project was successfully refined and made more presentable with improved structure and UI enhancements. All essential files were organized and uploaded to GitHub following proper repository practices. A detailed README file was added along with relevant screenshots to clearly explain the project. This step ensured that the project is well-documented, easy to understand, and ready for submission or evaluation.
